§§ `Rule 4 -- Person to take and manner of taking examination (O. 55, r. 4)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 55 r 4(1) the person before whom the examination is to be taken` IS ONE OF
    `o 55 r 4(1) a fit and proper person nominated by the person applying for the order`
    `o 55 r 4(1) the Registrar`
    `o 55 r 4(1) such other qualified person as to the Court seems fit`
    `o 55 r 4(1) someone else`

